<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Sept 19 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Sept 19 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $973.90 billion in the week to September 19 from $955.50 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					 Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		    51.36		44.38</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    23.68		17.46</p>
<p> Secondary market:		 922.54	     911.09</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues   188.58	     164.04</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear     713.40	     700.87</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	   260.50	     254.62</p>
</text>
